  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIG Component 2: Business Development Services (BDS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIG will directly improve SME capability and prepare firms for investment by providing business development services (BDS), enabling them to innovate, improve management, scale up and access new markets. BDS are trainings, mentoring and other services provided to firms to help them improve their capabilities, develop skills and competencies to scale up business ideas.</narrative>
  </description>
